// PASSED
// Cryptographically binding the result's verification 
// to the specific EDHOC secure channel instance, so that the attestation 
//cannot be replayed, spliced, or reused across different sessions, peers, or keys.
// PASSED
lemma ChannelBinding:
"All cid m credI credR psk gx y1 y2 prk gxy1 gxy2 pk_attkey sig meas nonce ak #i #j #l #k #u #c.
    AttestationAcceptedR(cid, credI, credR, sig, nonce, meas, psk, y1, gxy1, pk_attkey)@i 
    &
    AcceptR(cid, m, credI, credR, prk, gx, y2, psk, gxy2)@j
  ==>
    (Ex cidI gy x ak #t. DerivedI(cidI, m, credI, credR, prk, x, gy, psk, ak, gxy2)@t
    & t < j
    & gxy1 = gxy2)
    |
    (Ex #t. Compromise(psk)@t )
    |
    (Ex #t. LeakAttKey(ak)@t)
  "
